  "style": {
    "id": "ct-scan",
    "name": "CT Scan",
    "description": "Slice by slice: a sealed cardboard box rises on a lift through a white scanner ring in a bright white-and-teal room while a teal scan line crawls down it. Each slice appears as an exact grey cross-section (bright on a dark screen) of a baked voxel volume on a big floating panel; the slices peel off as thin translucent film cards, line up in a spaced row, close up into one block and become a ray-marched volume: a ghostly sand-coloured box with a coral toy robot inside and bright white-gold metal parts (gears, wind-up key, eyes, pins). A dial raises the threshold: cardboard fades, then plastic, leaving the metal turning in space. Scanner whirr, slice ticks, a run of snaps as the stack closes, a chord at the reveal, dial clicks.",
